                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "32,561 adults from the 1994 US census extract. One row per person: age, work class, education, marital status, occupation, race, sex, capital gains and losses, hours worked per week, country, and whether income is above 50,000 dollars a year. Missing values (marked ? in the source) are left empty.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "16pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Use the slicers at the top of a page to filter; a slicer keeps its selection on every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts.",
